WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.3 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Contracts and terms

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Every working relationship needs written terms that suit its type, checked locally.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Match the document to the relationship type.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Have templates checked by a qualified local adviser.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Track probation, renewal and end dates.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Trainees sign six-month apprenticeship contracts with pay, insurance and a training plan; Diego reviews each end date a month before.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write the terms each working relationship needs.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
